WEBVTT

00:15.000 --> 00:15.930
Zhang Haixia...

00:17.820 --> 00:19.330
You're crazy!

00:27.830 --> 00:29.560
Didn't you already know that?

01:10.800 --> 01:11.800
Come back with me.

01:17.510 --> 01:18.440
We can't go back.

02:38.500 --> 02:41.700
Looks like Commander Mo has achieved
his long-held wish.

02:59.740 --> 03:00.910
Is this the true purpose for which you

03:00.910 --> 03:02.710
and Mo Yungao came to Bailejing?

03:18.550 --> 03:19.210
Hailou,

03:20.510 --> 03:22.040
when that day really comes,

03:23.130 --> 03:24.690
you must not go soft on me.

03:50.360 --> 03:52.510
Please, Feikun Balu.

03:52.579 --> 03:53.860
Please save us.

04:00.360 --> 04:02.780
Lock all the windows
and go back to your room!

04:02.780 --> 04:04.330
Don't touch these things!

04:04.500 --> 04:07.100
Don't touch these things!
Don't touch them...

04:07.300 --> 04:08.360
Don't touch them.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.560
Don't touch them.

06:23.950 --> 06:30.080
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

06:30.410 --> 06:33.130
[Episode 30]

07:02.130 --> 07:02.790
Feng Huang?

07:05.240 --> 07:05.900
Feng Huang?

07:06.990 --> 07:07.750
Feng Huang.

07:10.450 --> 07:11.130
Feng Huang.

07:13.900 --> 07:15.360
Thank goodness, it's you.

07:15.750 --> 07:17.240
You scared the wits out of me.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.100
I thought...

07:18.230 --> 07:20.430
I thought it was that snake demon again.

07:20.440 --> 07:22.380
Look at you, so sheltered.

07:22.470 --> 07:23.390
So pathetic.

07:24.440 --> 07:25.700
You need to toughen up.

07:27.270 --> 07:28.540
What happened to your hands?

07:28.540 --> 07:29.710
What are you staring at?

07:29.710 --> 07:31.170
Hurry up and find a way out.

07:40.200 --> 07:41.260
Let's go. This way.

07:42.659 --> 07:43.270
My leg...

07:44.240 --> 07:45.370
What happened to it?

07:46.690 --> 07:48.190
I... I'll carry you.

07:54.500 --> 07:55.500
Let's go this way.

08:08.100 --> 08:09.180
What is this?

08:10.280 --> 08:12.940
Something related to
the Zhang family, I guess.

08:14.490 --> 08:16.550
It wasn't until today that I realized

08:16.740 --> 08:18.080
our family

08:18.350 --> 08:20.610
has been battling dangers all this time.

08:20.690 --> 08:22.410
Your family is really strange.

08:22.410 --> 08:23.530
Your siblings

08:23.560 --> 08:24.490
are unusual too.

08:25.330 --> 08:26.650
I was adopted.

08:27.950 --> 08:29.060
I was slow as a kid.

08:29.420 --> 08:31.220
I didn't speak until I was seven,

08:31.460 --> 08:33.659
so I was abandoned at the Taoist temple.

08:34.250 --> 08:36.049
I've stood guard all these years

08:36.890 --> 08:38.490
since my master passed away.

08:39.080 --> 08:40.030
Guard what?

08:41.260 --> 08:42.690
A promise—

08:44.030 --> 08:45.630
to wait for my master's wife.

08:46.220 --> 08:47.120
I've always

08:48.120 --> 08:50.580
thought that my master and I
were both fools.

08:50.840 --> 08:52.770
But after seeing my master's wife,

08:53.220 --> 08:55.020
I realized I was the bigger fool.

08:55.620 --> 08:56.720
I don't think so.

08:58.740 --> 08:59.720
In this world,

08:59.720 --> 09:02.100
most people are
ungrateful and untrustworthy.

09:02.100 --> 09:03.830
But your master was different.

09:03.870 --> 09:05.030
He did so much.

09:05.650 --> 09:07.450
I think someone like your master

09:08.200 --> 09:09.200
is hard to come by.

09:11.670 --> 09:13.240
You must've been poisoned

09:13.360 --> 09:15.060
by snake venom
to be saying such kind things.

09:15.060 --> 09:16.040
Oh, you...

09:16.350 --> 09:17.960
-I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
-Let's go.

09:17.960 --> 09:18.890
You're so heavy.

09:41.310 --> 09:42.110
Rest in peace,

09:43.050 --> 09:43.620
guys.

11:03.230 --> 11:04.840
Feikun Balu,

11:05.370 --> 11:06.710
you'll save me,

11:07.590 --> 11:08.330
right?

12:36.790 --> 12:37.590
Commander...

12:40.350 --> 12:41.330
Commander.

12:42.810 --> 12:43.960
Commander...

12:45.170 --> 12:45.980
Snake Master?

12:45.980 --> 12:48.730
I've been serving you for so long.

12:49.290 --> 12:50.600
Save me.

12:50.620 --> 12:53.470
Aren't you snake handlers supposed to be
immune to poison?

12:53.470 --> 12:54.690
Save me...

12:58.770 --> 13:01.750
It seems this is goodbye forever.

13:02.550 --> 13:03.530
Farewell.

13:04.320 --> 13:05.380
Tough luck for you.

13:06.230 --> 13:07.090
Commander...

13:14.760 --> 13:17.190
This day has finally come.

13:18.770 --> 13:21.660
Zhang Qiling will be here soon.

13:23.360 --> 13:24.120
Get ready.

13:24.150 --> 13:24.680
Yes, sir!

13:27.350 --> 13:29.410
Since we have no more Twilight Grass,

13:29.620 --> 13:31.750
bring out our guns and cannons,

13:32.200 --> 13:35.390
and line up to welcome the immortal.

13:40.150 --> 13:41.720
Zhang Qiling,

13:42.600 --> 13:44.870
look at the Twilight Grass everywhere

13:44.870 --> 13:47.200
and corpses scattered across the ground.

13:47.470 --> 13:49.250
Twenty years.

13:50.240 --> 13:52.890
Surely, you'll show yourself this time.

13:56.030 --> 13:58.390
[Young Mo Yungao]

14:23.330 --> 14:23.960
Look,

14:24.080 --> 14:25.570
that guy is eating slop,

14:25.680 --> 14:27.280
fighting with dogs for food.

14:27.410 --> 14:29.310
Yeah, like a fool.

14:29.740 --> 14:30.600
-Let's go.
-Go.

14:39.700 --> 14:40.720
What does this say?

14:40.720 --> 14:42.050
Join the ranks!

14:42.110 --> 14:43.520
Food and pay provided!

14:44.000 --> 14:45.390
Join the ranks!

14:45.390 --> 14:46.720
Food and pay provided!

14:48.440 --> 14:49.530
About face!

14:49.890 --> 14:50.600
Attention!

14:52.970 --> 14:53.930
Mo Yungao!

14:55.170 --> 14:55.770
Present!

14:55.960 --> 14:56.490
Step out!

14:56.720 --> 14:57.270
Yes, sir!

14:58.450 --> 14:59.190
Aim.

15:02.290 --> 15:02.950
Kneel down.

15:05.220 --> 15:06.080
Kneel down!

15:08.590 --> 15:09.120
Yes, sir.

15:16.970 --> 15:18.030
Move forward a bit.

15:38.880 --> 15:40.610
Don't drag your feet. Hurry up!

15:41.550 --> 15:43.210
One, two!

15:47.530 --> 15:48.250
Mo Yungao!

15:48.660 --> 15:49.190
Present!

15:49.700 --> 15:50.630
Halt!

15:57.340 --> 15:58.980
Sir, what are your orders?

16:03.330 --> 16:03.790
Well...

16:06.720 --> 16:07.250
Hurry up.

16:12.340 --> 16:12.870
Yes, sir.

16:39.910 --> 16:41.590
Platoon Leader Mo, your hat.

16:53.590 --> 16:54.560
Platoon Leader Mo.

16:54.560 --> 16:55.170
Present!

16:55.930 --> 16:56.660
Do your best.

16:57.530 --> 16:58.060
Yes, sir!

16:59.880 --> 17:00.940
[Southwestern Bandit Suppression
Campaign Plan]

17:02.270 --> 17:03.330
Platoon Leader Mo.

17:04.310 --> 17:04.839
Present.

17:05.260 --> 17:06.900
You're not getting any younger.

17:06.900 --> 17:08.760
Opportunities don't come often.

17:10.760 --> 17:12.160
I have high hopes for you.

17:14.240 --> 17:15.099
Thank you, sir.

17:22.440 --> 17:25.560
[Zhang Qiling, Chief of the Zhang Family]

18:25.710 --> 18:26.270
Report.

18:26.940 --> 18:28.420
[Investigation Report on
the Hidden Gifted in Nanqiang]

18:27.530 --> 18:30.570
The higher-ups have been
conducting research like this all along.

18:30.570 --> 18:32.070
Someone this extraordinary

18:32.070 --> 18:35.800
could be of tremendous value
to our future military preparedness.

18:36.030 --> 18:36.790
Mo Yungao.

18:36.790 --> 18:37.320
Present.

18:38.590 --> 18:39.850
Can you still find him?

18:42.580 --> 18:43.610
Yes, sir!

19:06.290 --> 19:07.550
Battalion Commander Mo,

19:07.550 --> 19:09.280
we've discovered a rare plant.

19:09.450 --> 19:10.610
It's highly toxic

19:10.630 --> 19:11.910
but hard to cultivate.

19:12.630 --> 19:14.390
We searched all of Nanqiang

19:14.610 --> 19:16.540
but still couldn't find its seeds.

19:22.710 --> 19:24.240
Use every means necessary.

19:24.280 --> 19:25.590
You must find them.

20:18.890 --> 20:19.520
Search!

20:37.670 --> 20:38.320
Sir,

20:39.360 --> 20:40.730
I have figured out a way

20:40.780 --> 20:42.410
to force out the Gifted.

20:43.120 --> 20:43.910
Do you think

20:44.670 --> 20:47.800
you could grant me authority
to mobilize more soldiers?

20:48.010 --> 20:49.140
When the time comes,

20:49.370 --> 20:50.770
I guarantee I'll help you

20:50.810 --> 20:52.290
achieve great success.

20:58.100 --> 20:59.340
Hello, Battalion Commander!

20:59.340 --> 21:01.000
Hello, Battalion Commander!

21:11.690 --> 21:14.620
Next, let's welcome
Division Commander Mo to speak.

21:40.020 --> 21:41.020
Please be seated.

21:45.160 --> 21:46.620
Thank you all.

21:47.910 --> 21:49.880
From today onward, we must

21:50.850 --> 21:53.110
work together with complete sincerity.

21:55.250 --> 21:57.250
I'll still need to rely on all of you.

21:59.470 --> 22:01.900
Today, I only have three points to make.

22:03.070 --> 22:03.790
First,

22:04.050 --> 22:07.110
all operations are to follow my command.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.090
Then,

22:10.460 --> 22:11.680
for the second point,

22:12.920 --> 22:14.650
don't say more than you need to.

22:15.850 --> 22:16.720
Third,

22:17.210 --> 22:18.650
you must be absolutely clear

22:18.650 --> 22:20.880
whose orders you're supposed to follow.

22:20.880 --> 22:21.920
Mine!

22:25.180 --> 22:25.960
Commander,

22:26.460 --> 22:29.520
what exactly is this method
for drawing out the Gifted?

22:30.180 --> 22:31.630
For so many years...

22:33.760 --> 22:34.810
how has this person

22:34.810 --> 22:37.640
managed to leave no trace whatsoever?

22:39.070 --> 22:42.270
The Gifted is drawn to
strange and mysterious phenomena.

22:43.330 --> 22:45.680
Then I'll create them.

22:46.200 --> 22:47.310
If I can't find him,

22:48.590 --> 22:50.450
why not make him come to me?

22:50.920 --> 22:51.750
That...

22:52.540 --> 22:54.360
That Evil God statue.

22:55.050 --> 22:56.400
I've already found

22:56.500 --> 22:58.270
the person who can control it.

22:58.810 --> 23:01.510
As long as we spread the statues out...

23:03.070 --> 23:04.880
we can use them as bait.

23:05.640 --> 23:06.770
How does that sound?

23:19.010 --> 23:20.540
Look at these Evil God statues.

23:20.540 --> 23:22.240
They are the same type as
the one from earlier,

23:22.240 --> 23:23.220
but they look like

23:23.220 --> 23:25.220
they were made in different places.

23:27.530 --> 23:29.090
You're asking me why?

23:29.090 --> 23:29.850
Run!

23:40.180 --> 23:41.110
Keep searching!

23:44.380 --> 23:46.040
If the Evil God Project fails,

23:46.520 --> 23:47.580
then I'm finished.

23:53.690 --> 23:55.490
I still have the Twilight Grass.

23:56.070 --> 23:57.730
We can pull off a Twilight Grass project.

23:57.730 --> 23:58.880
Tell Chen Xifeng

23:58.910 --> 24:00.380
to find the seeds quickly.

24:00.410 --> 24:01.440
Otherwise,

24:02.350 --> 24:04.040
you will be the seeds.

24:09.100 --> 24:11.390
[Many years later]

24:20.660 --> 24:21.970
Fortunately, I have not failed you.

24:21.970 --> 24:24.050
I've obtained the Twilight Grass seeds

24:24.050 --> 24:25.950
and fulfilled your instructions.

24:25.950 --> 24:27.380
Please be careful

24:27.400 --> 24:31.060
of the Southern Archives under
the Maritime Supervisory Office.

24:31.310 --> 24:31.980
Commander,

24:33.270 --> 24:34.300
I've already

24:34.320 --> 24:35.720
been to various places

24:35.780 --> 24:36.840
and investigated,

24:37.380 --> 24:39.620
but found no trace of
the so-called Southern Archives.

24:39.620 --> 24:41.530
However, we've captured several people

24:41.530 --> 24:43.330
suspected to be members of the Archives.

24:43.330 --> 24:45.190
Some of them revealed a few clues.

24:47.140 --> 24:47.940
The Southern Archives

24:47.940 --> 24:49.720
is an organization that specializes
in investigating mysterious incidents.

24:49.720 --> 24:51.920
Its top leader is Director Zhang Haiqi.

24:52.190 --> 24:55.390
And the person you're looking for
is called Zhang Qiling.

24:56.720 --> 24:59.210
You're saying his name is Zhang Qiling?

25:03.110 --> 25:04.130
Where is he now?

25:04.160 --> 25:05.100
I don't know.

25:05.120 --> 25:06.660
The last I heard,

25:07.180 --> 25:09.310
Zhang Qiling had appeared in Nanqiang

25:09.390 --> 25:11.030
and stayed there for quite some time.

25:11.030 --> 25:13.120
Seemed like
something was about to emerge there.

25:13.120 --> 25:14.670
If you want to know more,

25:14.700 --> 25:15.980
you can go to the Archives

25:15.980 --> 25:17.910
and look up files
with lower serial numbers.

25:17.910 --> 25:19.910
They contain records
of the Zhang family's core members

25:19.910 --> 25:20.970
and their secrets.

25:21.140 --> 25:22.070
But first,

25:22.070 --> 25:24.250
you need to find out
where the Archives is.

25:24.250 --> 25:25.070
So,

25:25.180 --> 25:27.110
you still need to find Zhang Haiqi.

25:31.080 --> 25:34.680
The Pitcher Plant Project can be
set in motion ahead of schedule.

25:35.790 --> 25:36.320
Yes, sir.

25:51.010 --> 25:51.670
Commander.

25:55.310 --> 25:57.250
Had a good time with your friend?

26:10.670 --> 26:13.200
Those weapons are all
meant for Zhang Qiling?

26:14.260 --> 26:16.860
I don't think those will be enough.
You'll die.

26:16.940 --> 26:17.670
And besides,

26:19.340 --> 26:21.800
how can you be sure
he'll definitely appear?

26:24.200 --> 26:26.250
Well, he is Feikun Balu.

26:26.310 --> 26:28.310
Now that I've destroyed Bailejing,

26:28.530 --> 26:29.770
he's bound to show up.

26:36.000 --> 26:39.130
We've nearly finished researching
the Twilight Grass.

26:39.140 --> 26:41.270
It's time to shift to studying people.

26:42.830 --> 26:44.720
I once fought seven others

26:45.100 --> 26:46.320
to the death.

26:47.090 --> 26:48.440
We tore into each other,

26:48.750 --> 26:49.900
biting like dogs,

26:51.880 --> 26:54.000
all for half a steamed bun like this.

26:55.260 --> 26:56.660
This is what people are.

26:59.720 --> 27:01.090
Boring.

27:03.750 --> 27:04.980
So now,

27:05.910 --> 27:07.960
I'd rather study immortals.

27:08.000 --> 27:09.410
The moment Zhang Qiling appears,

27:09.410 --> 27:10.630
capture him alive.

27:12.290 --> 27:14.950
Those weapons can
wipe out an entire battalion.

27:15.500 --> 27:17.000
No matter how powerful Zhang Qiling is,

27:17.000 --> 27:18.910
he can't withstand modern firearms, right?

27:18.910 --> 27:20.600
Unless he resorts to tricks.

27:20.630 --> 27:22.160
How do we capture him alive?

27:22.290 --> 27:24.310
You'll have to ask
Adjutant Zhang about that.

27:24.310 --> 27:25.330
He has an idea.

27:25.810 --> 27:27.470
I rarely ask favors of anyone.

27:27.550 --> 27:29.270
I finally asked him for one.

27:29.270 --> 27:31.730
He'll certainly come through for me.
Right?

27:34.620 --> 27:35.380
Commander,

27:36.230 --> 27:37.190
you helped me,

27:37.930 --> 27:39.460
so naturally I'll help you.

27:39.900 --> 27:41.760
But first, you need to understand

27:42.230 --> 27:43.690
what kind of place this is.

27:47.640 --> 27:49.100
Don't you find it strange?

27:49.670 --> 27:52.000
Why is Zhang Qiling
so drawn to this place?

27:53.700 --> 27:56.060
Why have
the Twilight Grass experiments here

27:56.060 --> 27:57.720
been such a complete success?

27:59.340 --> 28:00.470
Twenty years apart,

28:00.890 --> 28:03.020
and now returning to the same place...

28:05.140 --> 28:07.140
do you really think that's fate?

28:17.520 --> 28:20.110
Then you tell me. Why?

28:21.180 --> 28:22.630
Explain to me...

28:25.000 --> 28:26.460
what kind of place this is.

28:37.480 --> 28:38.810
Commander Mo's orders—

28:38.960 --> 28:40.560
capture Zhang Qiling alive!

29:00.770 --> 29:01.850
You really came.

29:13.950 --> 29:15.010
Someone is coming.

30:06.780 --> 30:07.910
Why just one person?

30:22.850 --> 30:24.330
Feikun Balu has appeared!

30:25.200 --> 30:26.030
Feikun Balu!

30:27.030 --> 30:27.960
Feikun Balu.

30:31.420 --> 30:32.430
Feikun Balu.

30:33.570 --> 30:35.090
You are no match for those people.

30:35.090 --> 30:36.590
Are we just going to let them

30:36.590 --> 30:38.140
murder our families?

30:38.370 --> 30:39.580
Go back immediately

30:39.670 --> 30:41.550
and protect those who are still alive.

30:41.550 --> 30:43.590
Don't let yourself
come into contact with the grass fluff.

30:43.590 --> 30:44.990
Leave those people to me.

30:45.660 --> 30:47.250
I'll end all of this.

31:49.770 --> 31:50.940
Zhang Qiling.

32:05.100 --> 32:06.510
He's really here.

32:19.770 --> 32:20.780
I want him alive.

32:22.000 --> 32:23.030
None of you are allowed to harm him.

32:23.030 --> 32:24.450
I... I want him alive.

33:25.590 --> 33:26.560
Come out,

33:27.180 --> 33:28.250
Mo Yungao.

33:40.420 --> 33:41.340
Commander Mo.

33:43.300 --> 33:45.910
It seems your fate is sealed today.

34:03.420 --> 34:04.220
Cover the Commander!

34:04.220 --> 34:05.420
Cover the Commander!

34:43.050 --> 34:44.010
Commander Mo,

34:44.460 --> 34:46.880
it seems your fate is sealed today.

34:49.000 --> 34:50.560
But I can help you.

34:51.070 --> 34:51.920
You retreat.

34:52.860 --> 34:54.060
I'll take your place.

35:18.760 --> 35:20.020
He's not Zhang Qiling.

35:24.820 --> 35:26.710
Even though he's not Zhang Qiling,

35:26.710 --> 35:28.510
he still gets to be the immortal?

35:32.610 --> 35:33.360
Why?

35:38.200 --> 35:39.600
What gives you the right?

35:46.980 --> 35:47.780
Zhang Haixia.

35:49.650 --> 35:51.850
Mo Yungao has harmed countless people.

35:52.480 --> 35:53.690
Why did you help him?

35:56.090 --> 35:58.000
Do you know why you failed?

36:00.000 --> 36:01.650
Because I know you too well.

36:03.280 --> 36:04.280
You're still you.

36:06.150 --> 36:08.080
But I'm not who I used to be anymore.

36:09.670 --> 36:11.380
If you want to kill me,

36:13.180 --> 36:14.910
then you'll have to change.

37:03.010 --> 37:04.240
Would an immortal

37:04.800 --> 37:06.260
like bullets?
